  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of education services to refugees in Nyarugusu, Mtendeli and Nduta camps in Kigoma Region, Tanzania - International Rescue Committee (IRC)  is a component of Refugee Response and Reform: Sustaining lives and securing a sustainable future for refugees and migrants in Western Tanzania reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,956,694. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
